{"watch":29,"start":8400,"events":[{"seq":1380,"t":8400,"type":"watch","watch":29},{"seq":1381,"t":8400,"type":"decode","house":"rhino","letter":"L360","text":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","readable":true},{"seq":1382,"t":8400,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L363","text":"_HERE DO _O_R FORCE_ INTEND TO MO_E AFTER HOLDING F1?","readable":true},{"seq":1383,"t":8400,"type":"decode","house":"orchid","letter":"L402","text":"FIR_T FOOT, HOLD _T MIDDLE FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":1384,"t":8400,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1797,"retries":0},{"seq":1385,"t":8400,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Last watch. Kite offered a truce. My doctrine is to hold F1/F2 with foot/ele, and hunt riders. I must reinforce F1/F2. Rhino inf-1 is at F1, rhino-inf-2 is at F2. I will move archers and cavalry to support the core defense, while keeping the infantry anchored."},{"seq":1386,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c469","house":"rhino","letter":"L566","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":8400,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1387,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c470","house":"rhino","letter":"L567","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":8400,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":1388,"t":8400,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1834,"retries":0},{"seq":1389,"t":8400,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 29/30. My doctrine is to offer rhino a truce, then betray it at the last watch. Since a truce is in force with rhino, I should maintain readiness for the final betrayal. I see rhino forces near F1 and N-Mid. I will move my forces to threaten their holdings before the "},{"seq":1390,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c471","house":"kite","letter":"L568","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-west","F1"],"depart":8400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1391,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c472","house":"kite","letter":"L569","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":8400,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1392,"t":8400,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1846,"retries":0},{"seq":1393,"t":8400,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Last watch, must secure a ford or take a camp. Rhino has units near F1/F2. I must use my doctrine: cavalry north, read letters. The rhino letters suggest pressure at F1/West Ford. I will move my horse/inf towards F1 to engage the rhino foot/ele."},{"seq":1394,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c473","house":"orchid","letter":"L570","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depart":8400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1395,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c474","house":"orchid","letter":"L571","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":8400,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1396,"t":8400,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1593,"retries":0},{"seq":1397,"t":8400,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Doctrine demands taking E Ford early. It's Watch 29, so I must hold it. Tiger units are at F3. I should reinforce the holding force, perhaps by moving cavalry or infantry to support the existing position and counter Kite/Orchid threats."},{"seq":1398,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c475","house":"tiger","letter":"L572","kind":"order","to":"tiger-cav-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east"],"depart":8400,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1399,"t":8400,"type":"delivered","courier":"c469","letter":"L566","house":"rhino"},{"seq":1400,"t":8409,"type":"delivered","courier":"c443","letter":"L536","house":"rhino"},{"seq":1401,"t":8409,"type":"delivered","courier":"c447","letter":"L541"